{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.20260507100500","title":"Operational docs are turning into agent-executable artifacts","desc":"Karpathy: artifact engineering akan meluas dari kode ke prompt, task recipe, dan instruction files untuk agent.","updated":1778775926059,"created":1778126965263,"tags":["zettel","documentation","agentic-engineering","prompt-engineering"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.20260507100500","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"0f85c38446ca6a018223f7ecdbc53f3c","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260507100500","id":"zettel.20260507100500","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260507100500","id":"zettel.20260507100500","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.documentation","alias":"documentation","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.documentation"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260507100500","id":"zettel.20260507100500","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.agentic-engineering","alias":"agentic-engineering","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.agentic-engineering"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260507100500","id":"zettel.20260507100500","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.prompt-engineering","alias":"prompt-engineering","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.prompt-engineering"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260507100500","id":"zettel.20260507100500","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.20260507100100","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":3,"offset":512},"end":{"line":13,"column":28,"offset":537},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.20260507100100"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260507100500","id":"zettel.20260507100500","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.youtube.andrej-karpathy-from-vibe-coding-to-agentic-engineering","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":3,"offset":540},"end":{"line":14,"column":76,"offset":613},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.youtube.andrej-karpathy-from-vibe-coding-to-agentic-engineering"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.20260507101200","id":"zettel.20260507101200","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":3,"offset":904},"end":{"line":15,"column":28,"offset":929},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.20260507100500"}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"operational-docs-are-turning-into-agent-executable-artifacts\">Operational docs are turning into agent-executable artifacts<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#operational-docs-are-turning-into-agent-executable-artifacts\"></a></h1>\n<p>Claim: Di era agentic engineering, dokumentasi operasional tidak hanya dibaca manusia tetapi juga menjadi input yang dapat dieksekusi oleh agent.</p>\n<p>Evidence:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Karpathy: \"What is the piece of text to copy paste to your agent? That's the programming paradigm.\"</li>\n<li>Diskusi tentang OpenClaw dan kebutuhan alat yang membaca instruksi, bukan hanya manusia.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Why it matters:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mengubah cara tim menulis dokumentasi dan runbook.</li>\n<li>Menandai transisi artifact engineering menuju format yang lebih executable.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See also:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260507100100\">Prompt and context become source code in Software 3.0</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.youtube.andrej-karpathy-from-vibe-coding-to-agentic-engineering\">Andrej Karpathy: From Vibe Coding to Agentic Engineering</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">documentation (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">agentic-engineering (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">prompt-engineering (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260507101200\">Largest AI opportunities are new work formats, not faster old workflows</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enableUserTags":true,"enableHashTags":true,"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","enableAutoFoldFrontmatter":false,"enableEditorDecorations":true,"maxPreviewsCached":10,"maxNoteLength":204800,"seeds":{"dendron.templates":{}},"enableFullHierarchyNoteTitle":false},"preview":{